                      "fill": "$ink-soft",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "In Agonara, model suggestions and curator drafts never become program content by themselves, accepted content is kept as revisions, and a student's answers are pinned to the revision they answered.",
