                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ORrmt",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "FolioTell: a Speech Synthesizer Behind a Reducer",
                  "lineHeight": 1.08,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 54,
                  "fontWeight": "500",
                  "letterSpacing": -0.8
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UiW2F",
                  "name": "Meta",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "29 August 2026  ·  3 min read  ·  Part 2 of 3 in FolioTell",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Zy8OW",
                  "name": "Lede",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AVSpeechSynthesizer is asynchronous and full of late callbacks. How FolioTell keeps playback correct with pure reducers, effect handlers and utterance tokens.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "L45ygW",
                  "name": "Rule",
                  "fill": "$accent",
                  "width": 64,
                  "height": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "g20J2A",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "On the surface a text-to-speech player has a handful of buttons: play, pause, stop, skip, speed. Underneath, AVSpeechSynthesizer is an asynchronous engine that reports back through delegate callbacks, and those callbacks arrive after you already changed your mind.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z6O0td",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Tap “next sentence” while a word is being spoken and the synthesizer may still tell you about the old utterance: one more word boundary, then a cancellation. FolioTell treats this as a state machine problem.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "I06CR2",
                  "name": "H2",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Events in, state and effects out",
                  "lineHeight": 1.2,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MsdxD",
                  "name": "Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The playback logic lives in FolioTellCore, a library with no UIKit, no SwiftUI and no AVFoundation. Its core is a reducer:",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
