                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Every button tap is an event, and so is every synthesizer callback. The reducer computes the next state and, optionally, an effect: start an utterance, restart it from an offset, pause. An effect handler performs it against the real engine through an injected adapter.",
